OL,3,GNEWSAUnder-threat market moves to new
OL,4,Alocation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city's weekly market is set to move
OL,7,Flocation for the first time in 30 years
OL,8,Fafter it was given a last-minute
OL,9,Freprieve.
OL,11,FThe outdoor market in Angel Place,
OL,12,FWorcester was placed under review by
OL,13,Fthe city council in May, leading to
OL,14,Fdoubts about its future.
OL,16,FBut the authority has since announced
OL,17,Fit will move to the Cornmarket in
OL,18,FSeptember under new operator, Bluebell
OL,19,FEvents, which runs markets in Droitwich
OL,20,Fand Evesham.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
